<title>HONG KONG: Bank Niaga launches US$40 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank Niaga launches US$40 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Sumitomo Finance Asia.</p>
<p>The issue will be formally launched on September 30.</p>
<p> BORROWER PT BANK NIAGA ACTING THROUGH ITS CAYMAN ISLANDS BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT	US$40 MLN   COUPON    6MS+80     MATURITY    5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    30.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     YRS 3,4     CALLS     YRS 3,4    REPLIES     1.5 WKS</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$250K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD   PAY DATE    OCT/NOV</p>
<p> NEG PLG  NO	    CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY INDONESIA  TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGER  US$8 MLN+  6 BP UNDERWRITING FEE</p>
<p>					   30 BP MANAGEMENT FEE</p>
<p> ARRANGER OVERSEA CHINESE BANKING CORP, SUMITOMO FINANCE ASIA</p>
<p>	    (BOOKS)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
